window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a425-5bfbfc7eb974e9b3.json"]={sha256:"5bfbfc7eb974e9b3d5af79a260224d3e5c0646ecfd14dece5e1dcebed19f30b0",value:{"id":"a425","title":"光學同調斷層掃描","titleEn":"Optical coherence tomography","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從寬頻光源的同調長度推出 OCT 的軸向解析度，理解頻域偵測如何把深度編碼成光譜干涉頻率、為何光譜儀的像素間距決定深度範圍與靈敏度衰減，再把光源頻寬、光譜儀色散、散粒雜訊極限、兩臂色散匹配與掃描光學整合成可驗收的斷層影像系統。","summaryEn":"Derive the axial resolution of OCT from the coherence length of a broadband source, see how Fourier-domain detection encodes depth as spectral interference frequency and why spectrometer pixel spacing sets depth range and sensitivity roll-off, then integrate source bandwidth, spectrometer dispersion, the shot-noise limit, arm dispersion matching and scanning optics into an acceptable tomographic imaging system.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-microscopy","subcategoryTitle":"先進顯微與光學影像","subcategoryTitleEn":"Advanced microscopy and optical imaging","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-microscopy","learningTags":["optics","optics-microscopy","interferometer"],"architectureFamily":"interferometer","architectureNodes":[["寬頻光源","Broadband source"],["光纖耦合器干涉儀","Fibre-coupler interferometer"],["參考臂與色散補償","Reference arm and dispersion compensation"],["樣品臂掃描光學","Sample-arm scanning optics"],["光譜儀與線型相機","Spectrometer and line camera"],["k 線性化與傅立葉重建","k-linearization and Fourier reconstruction"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"interferometer","labels":["寬頻光源","光纖耦合器干涉儀","參考臂與色散補償","樣品臂掃描光學","光譜儀與線型相機"],"labelsEn":["Broadband source","Fibre-coupler interferometer","Reference arm and dispersion compensation","Sample-arm scanning optics","Spectrometer and line camera"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：光譜域 OCT，λ₀ = 1050 nm、光源 Δλ = 100 nm、2048 像素光譜儀覆蓋 110 nm、A 掃描 100 kHz、樣品臂功率 1.5 mW。軸向解析度 δz = 0.441×1.05²/0.100 ≈ 4.9 µm（空氣），組織內 n = 1.38 約 3.5 µm。每像素 δλ = 110/2048 = 0.0537 nm，深度範圍 z_max = 1.05²/(4×0.0537×10⁻³) µm ≈ 5.1 mm（空氣），每像素深度 5.1 mm/1024 ≈ 5.0 µm，δz 約占 1 像素，屬於臨界取樣。光子能量 1.89×10⁻¹⁹ J，曝光 10 µs 內光子數 1.5×10⁻³×10⁻⁵/1.89×10⁻¹⁹ ≈ 7.9×10¹⁰，取 η = 0.7 得散粒雜訊極限 ≈ 5.6×10¹⁰ → 107 dB；在半深度 2.5 mm 處以 w = 1.5 估計衰減 −5.3 dB，可用靈敏度約 102 dB。若實測只有 95 dB，7 dB 差距要依序檢查耦合器分光比、光譜儀效率與參考光強度是否落在散粒雜訊主導區。眼睛約 24 mm 的水色散必須以參考臂水槽或數值補償匹配，否則視網膜處的 δz 會明顯寬於 4.9 µm。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Design exercise: spectral-domain OCT with λ₀ = 1050 nm, source Δλ = 100 nm, a 2048-pixel spectrometer spanning 110 nm, 100 kHz A-scan rate and 1.5 mW in the sample arm. Axial resolution δz = 0.441×1.05²/0.100 ≈ 4.9 µm in air, about 3.5 µm inside tissue with n = 1.38. Per-pixel δλ = 110/2048 = 0.0537 nm, depth range z_max = 1.05²/(4×0.0537×10⁻³) µm ≈ 5.1 mm in air, depth per pixel 5.1 mm/1024 ≈ 5.0 µm, so δz spans about one pixel, which is critical sampling. The photon energy is 1.89×10⁻¹⁹ J; in a 10 µs exposure the photon count is 1.5×10⁻³×10⁻⁵/1.89×10⁻¹⁹ ≈ 7.9×10¹⁰, and with η = 0.7 the shot-noise limit is about 5.6×10¹⁰, i.e. 107 dB; at half depth, 2.5 mm, the roll-off estimated with w = 1.5 is −5.3 dB, leaving about 102 dB usable. If only 95 dB is measured, the 7 dB gap is traced through the coupler split ratio, spectrometer efficiency and whether the reference power sits in the shot-noise-dominated regime. The roughly 24 mm of water in an eye must be matched by a reference-arm water cell or numerical compensation, otherwise δz at the retina is clearly wider than 4.9 µm. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a425-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「低同調干涉與軸向解析度」與「頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution\" and \"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a425-v12-01","title":"低同調干涉與軸向解析度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「寬頻光源與同調包絡」如何決定光學同調斷層掃描的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Broadband source and coherence envelope” determines the key performance of “Optical coherence tomography”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"OCT 是邁克森干涉儀的延伸：樣品臂的背向散射光只在與參考臂光程差小於光源同調長度時才產生干涉，因此干涉包絡的寬度就是深度方向的解析度，與物鏡數值孔徑無關。軸向解析度由中心波長與頻寬決定，橫向解析度則由聚焦光斑決定，兩者可以獨立設計；這正是 OCT 能用低數值孔徑光學取得微米級深度解析的原因。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「寬頻光源與同調包絡」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"OCT extends the Michelson interferometer: backscattered light from the sample arm interferes only when its path differs from the reference arm by less than the source coherence length, so the width of the interference envelope is the depth resolution, independent of objective numerical aperture. Axial resolution is set by centre wavelength and bandwidth, lateral resolution by the focused spot, and the two can be designed independently; this is why OCT achieves micrometre depth resolution with low-NA optics. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Broadband source and coherence envelope”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：高斯光譜的軸向解析度 δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ：λ₀ = 840 nm、Δλ = 50 nm 時 δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm（空氣），組織 n = 1.38 內約 4.5 µm；1310 nm、Δλ = 100 nm 則約 7.6 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a Gaussian spectrum the axial resolution is δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ: with λ₀ = 840 nm and Δλ = 50 nm, δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm in air, about 4.5 µm inside tissue with n = 1.38; at 1310 nm with Δλ = 100 nm it is about 7.6 µm.","failure":"常見誤解：「提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「寬頻光源與同調包絡」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Broadband source and coherence envelope”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-01-k1","title":"低同調干涉與軸向解析度","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution","text":"OCT 是邁克森干涉儀的延伸：樣品臂的背向散射光只在與參考臂光程差小於光源同調長度時才產生干涉，因此干涉包絡的寬度就是深度方向的解析度，與物鏡數值孔徑無關。軸向解析度由中心波長與頻寬決定，橫向解析度則由聚焦光斑決定，兩者可以獨立設計；這正是 OCT 能用低數值孔徑光學取得微米級深度解析的原因。","textEn":"OCT extends the Michelson interferometer: backscattered light from the sample arm interferes only when its path differs from the reference arm by less than the source coherence length, so the width of the interference envelope is the depth resolution, independent of objective numerical aperture. Axial resolution is set by centre wavelength and bandwidth, lateral resolution by the focused spot, and the two can be designed independently; this is why OCT achieves micrometre depth resolution with low-NA optics.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「低同調干涉與軸向解析度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution\" is correct?","options":["提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。","OCT 是邁克森干涉儀的延伸：樣品臂的背向散射光只在與參考臂光程差小於光源同調長度時才產生干涉，因此干涉包絡的寬度就是深度方向的解析度，與物鏡數值孔徑無關。","頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution.","OCT extends the Michelson interferometer: backscattered light from the sample arm interferes only when its path differs from the reference arm by less than the source coherence length, so the width of the interference envelope is the depth resolution, independent of objective numerical aperture.","In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue."],"answer":1,"explanation":"OCT 是邁克森干涉儀的延伸：樣品臂的背向散射光只在與參考臂光程差小於光源同調長度時才產生干涉，因此干涉包絡的寬度就是深度方向的解析度，與物鏡數值孔徑無關。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"OCT extends the Michelson interferometer: backscattered light from the sample arm interferes only when its path differs from the reference arm by less than the source coherence length, so the width of the interference envelope is the depth resolution, independent of objective numerical aperture. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a425-v12-02","title":"低同調干涉與軸向解析度：定量估算","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「寬頻光源與同調包絡」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Broadband source and coherence envelope” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：高斯光譜的軸向解析度 δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ：λ₀ = 840 nm、Δλ = 50 nm 時 δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm（空氣），組織 n = 1.38 內約 4.5 µm；1310 nm、Δλ = 100 nm 則約 7.6 µm。橫向光斑 Δx ≈ (4/π)·λ₀·f/d，f = 36 mm、d = 1.2 mm 時 Δx ≈ 32 µm，對應焦深 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 1.9 mm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a Gaussian spectrum the axial resolution is δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ: with λ₀ = 840 nm and Δλ = 50 nm, δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm in air, about 4.5 µm inside tissue with n = 1.38; at 1310 nm with Δλ = 100 nm it is about 7.6 µm. The lateral spot Δx ≈ (4/π)·λ₀·f/d is about 32 µm for f = 36 mm and d = 1.2 mm, with a depth of focus 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 1.9 mm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把一面鏡子放在樣品臂並取得單一反射的軸向點擴散函數，量其半高寬並與 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ 比較；同時用光譜儀量光源的實際頻寬與形狀，若光譜非高斯則預期出現旁瓣，應一併記錄旁瓣高度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place a mirror in the sample arm, acquire the axial point-spread function of the single reflection, measure its FWHM and compare with 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ; also measure the source bandwidth and shape on a spectrometer, and if the spectrum is non-Gaussian expect and record the side-lobe level.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"高斯光譜的軸向解析度 δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ：λ₀ = 840 nm、Δλ = 50 nm 時 δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm（空氣），組織 n = 1.38 內約 4.5 µm；1310 nm、Δλ = 100 nm 則約 7.6 µm。橫向光斑 Δx ≈ (4/π)·λ₀·f/d，f = 36 mm、d = 1.2 mm 時 Δx ≈ 32 µm，對應焦深 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 1.9 mm。","textEn":"For a Gaussian spectrum the axial resolution is δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ: with λ₀ = 840 nm and Δλ = 50 nm, δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm in air, about 4.5 µm inside tissue with n = 1.38; at 1310 nm with Δλ = 100 nm it is about 7.6 µm. The lateral spot Δx ≈ (4/π)·λ₀·f/d is about 32 µm for f = 36 mm and d = 1.2 mm, with a depth of focus 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 1.9 mm.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「低同調干涉與軸向解析度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution\", which statement holds?","options":["光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。","只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。","高斯光譜的軸向解析度 δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ：λ₀ = 840 nm、Δλ = 50 nm 時 δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm（空氣），組織 n = 1.38 內約 4.5 µm。"],"optionsEn":["More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution.","Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion.","For a Gaussian spectrum the axial resolution is δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ: with λ₀ = 840 nm and Δλ = 50 nm, δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm in air, about 4.5 µm inside tissue with n = 1.38."],"answer":2,"explanation":"高斯光譜的軸向解析度 δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ：λ₀ = 840 nm、Δλ = 50 nm 時 δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm（空氣），組織 n = 1.38 內約 4.5 µm；1310 nm、Δλ = 100 nm 則約 7.6 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a Gaussian spectrum the axial resolution is δz = (2·ln2/π)·λ₀²/Δλ = 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ: with λ₀ = 840 nm and Δλ = 50 nm, δz ≈ 0.441×0.84²/0.050 µm ≈ 6.2 µm in air, about 4.5 µm inside tissue with n = 1.38; at 1310 nm with Δλ = 100 nm it is about 7.6 µm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a425-v12-03","title":"低同調干涉與軸向解析度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「寬頻光源與同調包絡」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Broadband source and coherence envelope” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把一面鏡子放在樣品臂並取得單一反射的軸向點擴散函數，量其半高寬並與 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ 比較；同時用光譜儀量光源的實際頻寬與形狀，若光譜非高斯則預期出現旁瓣，應一併記錄旁瓣高度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place a mirror in the sample arm, acquire the axial point-spread function of the single reflection, measure its FWHM and compare with 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ; also measure the source bandwidth and shape on a spectrometer, and if the spectrum is non-Gaussian expect and record the side-lobe level. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：用頻寬標示值而非實測頻寬估算解析度，再加上光譜被濾波或耦合器裁切，實際 δz 可能比預期差 30% 以上，薄層結構無法分辨。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Estimating resolution from the nominal rather than the measured bandwidth, with the spectrum further clipped by filters or couplers, can make the real δz more than 30% worse than expected, so thin layers are not resolved.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把一面鏡子放在樣品臂並取得單一反射的軸向點擴散函數，量其半高寬並與 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ 比較；同時用光譜儀量光源的實際頻寬與形狀，若光譜非高斯則預期出現旁瓣，應一併記錄旁瓣高度。","textEn":"Place a mirror in the sample arm, acquire the axial point-spread function of the single reflection, measure its FWHM and compare with 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ; also measure the source bandwidth and shape on a spectrometer, and if the spectrum is non-Gaussian expect and record the side-lobe level.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「低同調干涉與軸向解析度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution\"?","options":["把一面鏡子放在樣品臂並取得單一反射的軸向點擴散函數，量其半高寬並與 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ 比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。"],"optionsEn":["Place a mirror in the sample arm, acquire the axial point-spread function of the single reflection, measure its FWHM and compare with 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把一面鏡子放在樣品臂並取得單一反射的軸向點擴散函數，量其半高寬並與 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ 比較；同時用光譜儀量光源的實際頻寬與形狀，若光譜非高斯則預期出現旁瓣，應一併記錄旁瓣高度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place a mirror in the sample arm, acquire the axial point-spread function of the single reflection, measure its FWHM and compare with 0.441·λ₀²/Δλ; also measure the source bandwidth and shape on a spectrometer, and if the spectrum is non-Gaussian expect and record the side-lobe level. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a425-v12-04","title":"低同調干涉與軸向解析度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「寬頻光源與同調包絡」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Broadband source and coherence envelope” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"用頻寬標示值而非實測頻寬估算解析度，再加上光譜被濾波或耦合器裁切，實際 δz 可能比預期差 30% 以上，薄層結構無法分辨。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Estimating resolution from the nominal rather than the measured bandwidth, with the spectrum further clipped by filters or couplers, can make the real δz more than 30% worse than expected, so thin layers are not resolved. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：軸向解析度由中心波長與頻寬決定，橫向解析度則由聚焦光斑決定，兩者可以獨立設計；這正是 OCT 能用低數值孔徑光學取得微米級深度解析的原因。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Axial resolution is set by centre wavelength and bandwidth, lateral resolution by the focused spot, and the two can be designed independently; this is why OCT achieves micrometre depth resolution with low-NA optics.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用頻寬標示值而非實測頻寬估算解析度，再加上光譜被濾波或耦合器裁切，實際 δz 可能比預期差 30% 以上，薄層結構無法分辨。","textEn":"Estimating resolution from the nominal rather than the measured bandwidth, with the spectrum further clipped by filters or couplers, can make the real δz more than 30% worse than expected, so thin layers are not resolved.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「低同調干涉與軸向解析度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Low-coherence interference and axial resolution\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","用頻寬標示值而非實測頻寬估算解析度，再加上光譜被濾波或耦合器裁切，實際 δz 可能比預期差 30% 以上，薄層結構無法分辨。","頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Estimating resolution from the nominal rather than the measured bandwidth, with the spectrum further clipped by filters or couplers, can make the real δz more than 30% worse than expected, so thin layers are not resolved.","In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用頻寬標示值而非實測頻寬估算解析度，再加上光譜被濾波或耦合器裁切，實際 δz 可能比預期差 30% 以上，薄層結構無法分辨。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Estimating resolution from the nominal rather than the measured bandwidth, with the spectrum further clipped by filters or couplers, can make the real δz more than 30% worse than expected, so thin layers are not resolved. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a425-v12-05","title":"頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「光譜干涉圖與傅立葉轉換」如何決定光學同調斷層掃描的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Spectral interferogram and Fourier transform” determines the key performance of “Optical coherence tomography”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"頻域 OCT 不移動參考鏡，而是記錄整個光譜的干涉圖 I(k) ∝ S(k)[1 + Σ2√(R_r·R_n)·cos(2k·z_n) + …]；每個深度 z_n 對應光譜中一個頻率 2z_n，對 k 做傅立葉轉換即得到整條深度剖面。因為所有深度同時偵測，靈敏度比時域 OCT 高出 N/2 倍；但光譜儀有限的解析度讓高頻干涉條紋被平滑，深度越大、訊號越弱，這就是靈敏度衰減。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光譜干涉圖與傅立葉轉換」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Fourier-domain OCT keeps the reference mirror fixed and records the interferogram across the spectrum, I(k) ∝ S(k)[1 + Σ2√(R_r·R_n)·cos(2k·z_n) + …]; each depth z_n maps to a spectral frequency 2z_n, and a Fourier transform over k returns the whole depth profile. Because all depths are detected simultaneously the sensitivity exceeds time-domain OCT by N/2; but the finite spectral resolution of the spectrometer smooths the high-frequency fringes, so signal falls with depth, which is the sensitivity roll-off. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Spectral interferogram and Fourier transform”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：深度範圍 z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ)：λ₀ = 840 nm、每像素 δλ = 0.050 nm 時 z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm（空氣）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Depth range z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ): for λ₀ = 840 nm and δλ = 0.050 nm per pixel, z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm in air.","failure":"常見誤解：「頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光譜干涉圖與傅立葉轉換」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Spectral interferogram and Fourier transform”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-05-k1","title":"頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減","titleEn":"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT","text":"頻域 OCT 不移動參考鏡，而是記錄整個光譜的干涉圖 I(k) ∝ S(k)[1 + Σ2√(R_r·R_n)·cos(2k·z_n) + …]；每個深度 z_n 對應光譜中一個頻率 2z_n，對 k 做傅立葉轉換即得到整條深度剖面。因為所有深度同時偵測，靈敏度比時域 OCT 高出 N/2 倍；但光譜儀有限的解析度讓高頻干涉條紋被平滑，深度越大、訊號越弱，這就是靈敏度衰減。","textEn":"Fourier-domain OCT keeps the reference mirror fixed and records the interferogram across the spectrum, I(k) ∝ S(k)[1 + Σ2√(R_r·R_n)·cos(2k·z_n) + …]; each depth z_n maps to a spectral frequency 2z_n, and a Fourier transform over k returns the whole depth profile. Because all depths are detected simultaneously the sensitivity exceeds time-domain OCT by N/2; but the finite spectral resolution of the spectrometer smooths the high-frequency fringes, so signal falls with depth, which is the sensitivity roll-off.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT\" is correct?","options":["頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。","光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。","頻域 OCT 不移動參考鏡，而是記錄整個光譜的干涉圖 I(k) ∝ S(k)[1 + Σ2√(R_r·R_n)·cos(2k·z_n) + …]。"],"optionsEn":["In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue.","A broader source always gives a better image at every depth.","Fourier-domain OCT keeps the reference mirror fixed and records the interferogram across the spectrum, I(k) ∝ S(k)[1 + Σ2√(R_r·R_n)·cos(2k·z_n) + …]."],"answer":2,"explanation":"頻域 OCT 不移動參考鏡，而是記錄整個光譜的干涉圖 I(k) ∝ S(k)[1 + Σ2√(R_r·R_n)·cos(2k·z_n) + …]；每個深度 z_n 對應光譜中一個頻率 2z_n，對 k 做傅立葉轉換即得到整條深度剖面。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Fourier-domain OCT keeps the reference mirror fixed and records the interferogram across the spectrum, I(k) ∝ S(k)[1 + Σ2√(R_r·R_n)·cos(2k·z_n) + …]; each depth z_n maps to a spectral frequency 2z_n, and a Fourier transform over k returns the whole depth profile. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a425-v12-06","title":"頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減：定量估算","titleEn":"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光譜干涉圖與傅立葉轉換」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Spectral interferogram and Fourier transform” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：深度範圍 z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ)：λ₀ = 840 nm、每像素 δλ = 0.050 nm 時 z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm（空氣）。N = 2048 像素的靈敏度增益 10·log₁₀(N/2) ≈ 30 dB。衰減 R(z) = [sinζ/ζ]²·exp[−w²ζ²/(2ln2)]，ζ = (π/2)·z/z_max，w 為光譜解析度與像素間距之比；w = 1.5 時半深度處約 −5.3 dB，全深度處約 −21 dB。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Depth range z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ): for λ₀ = 840 nm and δλ = 0.050 nm per pixel, z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm in air. With N = 2048 pixels the sensitivity gain is 10·log₁₀(N/2) ≈ 30 dB. Roll-off is R(z) = [sinζ/ζ]²·exp[−w²ζ²/(2ln2)] with ζ = (π/2)·z/z_max and w the ratio of spectral resolution to pixel spacing; for w = 1.5 it is about −5.3 dB at half depth and about −21 dB at full depth. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以鏡面反射在不同參考臂位置取得峰值，畫出峰值強度對深度的曲線並擬合 sinc² 與高斯項，反推 w 值；再把量到的 z_max 與 λ₀²/(4·δλ) 比較，確認光譜儀像素間距的校正值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record the mirror peak at a series of reference-arm positions, plot peak intensity against depth, fit the sinc² and Gaussian terms to extract w; then compare the measured z_max with λ₀²/(4·δλ) to confirm the calibrated spectrometer pixel spacing.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"深度範圍 z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ)：λ₀ = 840 nm、每像素 δλ = 0.050 nm 時 z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm（空氣）。N = 2048 像素的靈敏度增益 10·log₁₀(N/2) ≈ 30 dB。衰減 R(z) = [sinζ/ζ]²·exp[−w²ζ²/(2ln2)]，ζ = (π/2)·z/z_max，w 為光譜解析度與像素間距之比；w = 1.5 時半深度處約 −5.3 dB，全深度處約 −21 dB。","textEn":"Depth range z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ): for λ₀ = 840 nm and δλ = 0.050 nm per pixel, z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm in air. With N = 2048 pixels the sensitivity gain is 10·log₁₀(N/2) ≈ 30 dB. Roll-off is R(z) = [sinζ/ζ]²·exp[−w²ζ²/(2ln2)] with ζ = (π/2)·z/z_max and w the ratio of spectral resolution to pixel spacing; for w = 1.5 it is about −5.3 dB at half depth and about −21 dB at full depth.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT\", which statement holds?","options":["深度範圍 z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ)：λ₀ = 840 nm、每像素 δλ = 0.050 nm 時 z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm（空氣）。","增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。","用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。"],"optionsEn":["Depth range z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ): for λ₀ = 840 nm and δλ = 0.050 nm per pixel, z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm in air.","Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power.","A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth."],"answer":0,"explanation":"深度範圍 z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ)：λ₀ = 840 nm、每像素 δλ = 0.050 nm 時 z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm（空氣）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Depth range z_max = λ₀²/(4·n·δλ): for λ₀ = 840 nm and δλ = 0.050 nm per pixel, z_max ≈ 0.7056/(4×5×10⁻⁵) µm ≈ 3.5 mm in air. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a425-v12-07","title":"頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光譜干涉圖與傅立葉轉換」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Spectral interferogram and Fourier transform” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以鏡面反射在不同參考臂位置取得峰值，畫出峰值強度對深度的曲線並擬合 sinc² 與高斯項，反推 w 值；再把量到的 z_max 與 λ₀²/(4·δλ) 比較，確認光譜儀像素間距的校正值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record the mirror peak at a series of reference-arm positions, plot peak intensity against depth, fit the sinc² and Gaussian terms to extract w; then compare the measured z_max with λ₀²/(4·δλ) to confirm the calibrated spectrometer pixel spacing. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把樣品放在接近 z_max 的位置成像，訊號比零深度處低 20 dB 以上，深層結構消失，而且超過 z_max 的訊號會鏡像摺疊回影像中造成假結構。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Imaging a sample placed near z_max loses more than 20 dB relative to zero depth so deep structures vanish, and signal beyond z_max folds back as a mirror image that creates false structures.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以鏡面反射在不同參考臂位置取得峰值，畫出峰值強度對深度的曲線並擬合 sinc² 與高斯項，反推 w 值；再把量到的 z_max 與 λ₀²/(4·δλ) 比較，確認光譜儀像素間距的校正值。","textEn":"Record the mirror peak at a series of reference-arm positions, plot peak intensity against depth, fit the sinc² and Gaussian terms to extract w; then compare the measured z_max with λ₀²/(4·δλ) to confirm the calibrated spectrometer pixel spacing.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以鏡面反射在不同參考臂位置取得峰值，畫出峰值強度對深度的曲線並擬合 sinc² 與高斯項，反推 w 值。","影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Record the mirror peak at a series of reference-arm positions, plot peak intensity against depth, fit the sinc² and Gaussian terms to extract w.","A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以鏡面反射在不同參考臂位置取得峰值，畫出峰值強度對深度的曲線並擬合 sinc² 與高斯項，反推 w 值；再把量到的 z_max 與 λ₀²/(4·δλ) 比較，確認光譜儀像素間距的校正值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record the mirror peak at a series of reference-arm positions, plot peak intensity against depth, fit the sinc² and Gaussian terms to extract w; then compare the measured z_max with λ₀²/(4·δλ) to confirm the calibrated spectrometer pixel spacing. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a425-v12-08","title":"頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減：失效診斷","titleEn":"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光譜干涉圖與傅立葉轉換」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Spectral interferogram and Fourier transform” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把樣品放在接近 z_max 的位置成像，訊號比零深度處低 20 dB 以上，深層結構消失，而且超過 z_max 的訊號會鏡像摺疊回影像中造成假結構。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Imaging a sample placed near z_max loses more than 20 dB relative to zero depth so deep structures vanish, and signal beyond z_max folds back as a mirror image that creates false structures. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：因為所有深度同時偵測，靈敏度比時域 OCT 高出 N/2 倍；但光譜儀有限的解析度讓高頻干涉條紋被平滑，深度越大、訊號越弱，這就是靈敏度衰減。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because all depths are detected simultaneously the sensitivity exceeds time-domain OCT by N/2; but the finite spectral resolution of the spectrometer smooths the high-frequency fringes, so signal falls with depth, which is the sensitivity roll-off.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把樣品放在接近 z_max 的位置成像，訊號比零深度處低 20 dB 以上，深層結構消失，而且超過 z_max 的訊號會鏡像摺疊回影像中造成假結構。","textEn":"Imaging a sample placed near z_max loses more than 20 dB relative to zero depth so deep structures vanish, and signal beyond z_max folds back as a mirror image that creates false structures.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「頻域 OCT 的深度編碼與靈敏度衰減」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Depth encoding and sensitivity roll-off in Fourier-domain OCT\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。","把樣品放在接近 z_max 的位置成像，訊號比零深度處低 20 dB 以上，深層結構消失，而且超過 z_max 的訊號會鏡像摺疊回影像中造成假結構。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A broader source always gives a better image at every depth.","Imaging a sample placed near z_max loses more than 20 dB relative to zero depth so deep structures vanish, and signal beyond z_max folds back as a mirror image that creates false structures."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把樣品放在接近 z_max 的位置成像，訊號比零深度處低 20 dB 以上，深層結構消失，而且超過 z_max 的訊號會鏡像摺疊回影像中造成假結構。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Imaging a sample placed near z_max loses more than 20 dB relative to zero depth so deep structures vanish, and signal beyond z_max folds back as a mirror image that creates false structures. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a425-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨」與「光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off\" and \"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a425-v12-09","title":"寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「超輻射二極體與光譜形狀」如何決定光學同調斷層掃描的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Superluminescent diode and spectral shape” determines the key performance of “Optical coherence tomography”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"超輻射二極體提供數十奈米的頻寬與毫瓦級功率，掃頻雷射則以時間掃描波長；兩者都要求光譜平滑、無漣波，因為光譜上的任何週期結構會在深度剖面上變成假峰。頻寬加大能縮小 δz，但固定像素數的光譜儀必須覆蓋更寬的波段，每像素的 δλ 隨之變大、深度範圍縮小，所以頻寬選擇是解析度與深度範圍的直接取捨；眼睛的安全曝光上限又限制了可用功率。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「超輻射二極體與光譜形狀」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Superluminescent diodes deliver tens of nanometres of bandwidth at milliwatt power, while swept lasers scan wavelength in time; both need smooth, ripple-free spectra because any periodic spectral structure becomes a false peak in the depth profile. Wider bandwidth shrinks δz, but a spectrometer with a fixed pixel count must cover a wider band, so δλ per pixel grows and depth range shrinks; bandwidth choice is a direct trade between resolution and depth range, and ocular exposure limits cap the usable power. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Superluminescent diode and spectral shape”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：在 λ₀ = 840 nm：Δλ = 50、100、150 nm 分別給 δz ≈ 6.2、3.1、2.1 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At λ₀ = 840 nm, Δλ = 50, 100 and 150 nm give δz ≈ 6.2, 3.1 and 2.1 µm.","failure":"常見誤解：「光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A broader source always gives a better image at every depth.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「超輻射二極體與光譜形狀」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Superluminescent diode and spectral shape”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-09-k1","title":"寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨","titleEn":"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off","text":"超輻射二極體提供數十奈米的頻寬與毫瓦級功率，掃頻雷射則以時間掃描波長；兩者都要求光譜平滑、無漣波，因為光譜上的任何週期結構會在深度剖面上變成假峰。頻寬加大能縮小 δz，但固定像素數的光譜儀必須覆蓋更寬的波段，每像素的 δλ 隨之變大、深度範圍縮小，所以頻寬選擇是解析度與深度範圍的直接取捨；眼睛的安全曝光上限又限制了可用功率。","textEn":"Superluminescent diodes deliver tens of nanometres of bandwidth at milliwatt power, while swept lasers scan wavelength in time; both need smooth, ripple-free spectra because any periodic spectral structure becomes a false peak in the depth profile. Wider bandwidth shrinks δz, but a spectrometer with a fixed pixel count must cover a wider band, so δλ per pixel grows and depth range shrinks; bandwidth choice is a direct trade between resolution and depth range, and ocular exposure limits cap the usable power.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A broader source always gives a better image at every depth. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off\" is correct?","options":["超輻射二極體提供數十奈米的頻寬與毫瓦級功率，掃頻雷射則以時間掃描波長；兩者都要求光譜平滑、無漣波，因為光譜上的任何週期結構會在深度剖面上變成假峰。","光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。","光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。"],"optionsEn":["Superluminescent diodes deliver tens of nanometres of bandwidth at milliwatt power, while swept lasers scan wavelength in time.","A broader source always gives a better image at every depth.","More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution."],"answer":0,"explanation":"超輻射二極體提供數十奈米的頻寬與毫瓦級功率，掃頻雷射則以時間掃描波長；兩者都要求光譜平滑、無漣波，因為光譜上的任何週期結構會在深度剖面上變成假峰。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Superluminescent diodes deliver tens of nanometres of bandwidth at milliwatt power, while swept lasers scan wavelength in time; both need smooth, ripple-free spectra because any periodic spectral structure becomes a false peak in the depth profile. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a425-v12-10","title":"寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨：定量估算","titleEn":"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「超輻射二極體與光譜形狀」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Superluminescent diode and spectral shape” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：在 λ₀ = 840 nm：Δλ = 50、100、150 nm 分別給 δz ≈ 6.2、3.1、2.1 µm。若 2048 像素光譜儀覆蓋 100 nm，δλ = 0.0488 nm、z_max ≈ 3.6 mm；覆蓋 200 nm 以容納更寬光源時 δλ = 0.0977 nm、z_max ≈ 1.8 mm。每個 840 nm 光子能量 hc/λ ≈ 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J，1 mW 相當於每秒 4.2×10¹⁵ 個光子。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At λ₀ = 840 nm, Δλ = 50, 100 and 150 nm give δz ≈ 6.2, 3.1 and 2.1 µm. If a 2048-pixel spectrometer spans 100 nm, δλ = 0.0488 nm and z_max ≈ 3.6 mm; spanning 200 nm to admit a broader source gives δλ = 0.0977 nm and z_max ≈ 1.8 mm. Each 840 nm photon carries hc/λ ≈ 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J, so 1 mW is 4.2×10¹⁵ photons per second. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用光譜分析儀量光源光譜的半高寬與漣波深度，計算預期 δz 與假峰位置（漣波週期 δλ_r 對應深度 λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)），再以鏡面點擴散函數確認旁瓣與假峰低於主峰 30 dB 以上。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the source FWHM and ripple depth on an optical spectrum analyser, compute the expected δz and the ghost-peak position (a ripple period δλ_r maps to depth λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)), then confirm with a mirror point-spread function that side lobes and ghost peaks sit more than 30 dB below the main peak.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"在 λ₀ = 840 nm：Δλ = 50、100、150 nm 分別給 δz ≈ 6.2、3.1、2.1 µm。若 2048 像素光譜儀覆蓋 100 nm，δλ = 0.0488 nm、z_max ≈ 3.6 mm；覆蓋 200 nm 以容納更寬光源時 δλ = 0.0977 nm、z_max ≈ 1.8 mm。每個 840 nm 光子能量 hc/λ ≈ 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J，1 mW 相當於每秒 4.2×10¹⁵ 個光子。","textEn":"At λ₀ = 840 nm, Δλ = 50, 100 and 150 nm give δz ≈ 6.2, 3.1 and 2.1 µm. If a 2048-pixel spectrometer spans 100 nm, δλ = 0.0488 nm and z_max ≈ 3.6 mm; spanning 200 nm to admit a broader source gives δλ = 0.0977 nm and z_max ≈ 1.8 mm. Each 840 nm photon carries hc/λ ≈ 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J, so 1 mW is 4.2×10¹⁵ photons per second.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off\", which statement holds?","options":["只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。","在 λ₀ = 840 nm：Δλ = 50、100、150 nm 分別給 δz ≈ 6.2、3.1、2.1 µm。","影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。"],"optionsEn":["Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion.","At λ₀ = 840 nm, Δλ = 50, 100 and 150 nm give δz ≈ 6.2, 3.1 and 2.1 µm.","A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在 λ₀ = 840 nm：Δλ = 50、100、150 nm 分別給 δz ≈ 6.2、3.1、2.1 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At λ₀ = 840 nm, Δλ = 50, 100 and 150 nm give δz ≈ 6.2, 3.1 and 2.1 µm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a425-v12-11","title":"寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「超輻射二極體與光譜形狀」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Superluminescent diode and spectral shape” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用光譜分析儀量光源光譜的半高寬與漣波深度，計算預期 δz 與假峰位置（漣波週期 δλ_r 對應深度 λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)），再以鏡面點擴散函數確認旁瓣與假峰低於主峰 30 dB 以上。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the source FWHM and ripple depth on an optical spectrum analyser, compute the expected δz and the ghost-peak position (a ripple period δλ_r maps to depth λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)), then confirm with a mirror point-spread function that side lobes and ghost peaks sit more than 30 dB below the main peak. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：光源驅動電流或溫度漂移使光譜重心移動與頻寬縮小，δz 變差且深度比例尺改變；光纖端面的回光進入超輻射二極體則造成光譜漣波與整幅影像的固定假層。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Drift of drive current or temperature shifts the spectral centroid and narrows the bandwidth, degrading δz and changing the depth scale; back-reflection from a fibre facet into the superluminescent diode adds spectral ripple that appears as a fixed false layer across the image.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用光譜分析儀量光源光譜的半高寬與漣波深度，計算預期 δz 與假峰位置（漣波週期 δλ_r 對應深度 λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)），再以鏡面點擴散函數確認旁瓣與假峰低於主峰 30 dB 以上。","textEn":"Measure the source FWHM and ripple depth on an optical spectrum analyser, compute the expected δz and the ghost-peak position (a ripple period δλ_r maps to depth λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)), then confirm with a mirror point-spread function that side lobes and ghost peaks sit more than 30 dB below the main peak.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。","用光譜分析儀量光源光譜的半高寬與漣波深度，計算預期 δz 與假峰位置（漣波週期 δλ_r 對應深度 λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)），再以鏡面點擴散函數確認旁瓣與假峰低於主峰 30 dB 以上。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution.","Measure the source FWHM and ripple depth on an optical spectrum analyser, compute the expected δz and the ghost-peak position (a ripple period δλ_r maps to depth λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)), then confirm with a mirror point-spread function that side lobes and ghost peaks sit more than 30 dB below the main peak."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用光譜分析儀量光源光譜的半高寬與漣波深度，計算預期 δz 與假峰位置（漣波週期 δλ_r 對應深度 λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)），再以鏡面點擴散函數確認旁瓣與假峰低於主峰 30 dB 以上。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the source FWHM and ripple depth on an optical spectrum analyser, compute the expected δz and the ghost-peak position (a ripple period δλ_r maps to depth λ₀²/(2·δλ_r)), then confirm with a mirror point-spread function that side lobes and ghost peaks sit more than 30 dB below the main peak. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a425-v12-12","title":"寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨：失效診斷","titleEn":"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「超輻射二極體與光譜形狀」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Superluminescent diode and spectral shape” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"光源驅動電流或溫度漂移使光譜重心移動與頻寬縮小，δz 變差且深度比例尺改變；光纖端面的回光進入超輻射二極體則造成光譜漣波與整幅影像的固定假層。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Drift of drive current or temperature shifts the spectral centroid and narrows the bandwidth, degrading δz and changing the depth scale; back-reflection from a fibre facet into the superluminescent diode adds spectral ripple that appears as a fixed false layer across the image. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：頻寬加大能縮小 δz，但固定像素數的光譜儀必須覆蓋更寬的波段，每像素的 δλ 隨之變大、深度範圍縮小，所以頻寬選擇是解析度與深度範圍的直接取捨；眼睛的安全曝光上限又限制了可用功率。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Wider bandwidth shrinks δz, but a spectrometer with a fixed pixel count must cover a wider band, so δλ per pixel grows and depth range shrinks; bandwidth choice is a direct trade between resolution and depth range, and ocular exposure limits cap the usable power.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A broader source always gives a better image at every depth.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"光源驅動電流或溫度漂移使光譜重心移動與頻寬縮小，δz 變差且深度比例尺改變；光纖端面的回光進入超輻射二極體則造成光譜漣波與整幅影像的固定假層。","textEn":"Drift of drive current or temperature shifts the spectral centroid and narrows the bandwidth, degrading δz and changing the depth scale; back-reflection from a fibre facet into the superluminescent diode adds spectral ripple that appears as a fixed false layer across the image.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「寬頻光源、頻寬與深度範圍的取捨」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Broadband source, bandwidth and the depth-range trade-off\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["光源驅動電流或溫度漂移使光譜重心移動與頻寬縮小，δz 變差且深度比例尺改變；光纖端面的回光進入超輻射二極體則造成光譜漣波與整幅影像的固定假層。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。"],"optionsEn":["Drift of drive current or temperature shifts the spectral centroid and narrows the bandwidth, degrading δz and changing the depth scale.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution."],"answer":0,"explanation":"光源驅動電流或溫度漂移使光譜重心移動與頻寬縮小，δz 變差且深度比例尺改變；光纖端面的回光進入超輻射二極體則造成光譜漣波與整幅影像的固定假層。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Drift of drive current or temperature shifts the spectral centroid and narrows the bandwidth, degrading δz and changing the depth scale; back-reflection from a fibre facet into the superluminescent diode adds spectral ripple that appears as a fixed false layer across the image. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a425-v12-13","title":"光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「光柵光譜儀與線型相機」如何決定光學同調斷層掃描的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Grating spectrometer and line camera” determines the key performance of “Optical coherence tomography”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"光譜域 OCT 的光譜儀由準直鏡、繞射光柵、聚焦鏡與線型相機組成；光柵方程式 sinα + sinβ = mλ/d 給出偏向角，線色散 dλ/dx = d·cosβ/(m·f) 決定每個像素覆蓋的波長。相機像素在波長上等距，但傅立葉轉換需要在波數 k = 2π/λ 上等距，所以在轉換前必須重新取樣；省略這一步，點擴散函數會隨深度迅速變寬。光譜儀的聚焦品質決定 w 值，也就是衰減速率。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光柵光譜儀與線型相機」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The spectrometer of spectral-domain OCT consists of a collimator, a diffraction grating, a focusing lens and a line camera; the grating equation sinα + sinβ = mλ/d gives the diffraction angle and the linear dispersion dλ/dx = d·cosβ/(m·f) sets the wavelength per pixel. Camera pixels are equally spaced in wavelength but the Fourier transform needs equal spacing in wavenumber k = 2π/λ, so the data must be resampled before transforming; skipping this step broadens the point-spread function rapidly with depth. The focusing quality of the spectrometer sets w and therefore the roll-off rate. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Grating spectrometer and line camera”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：1200 線/mm 光柵（d = 0.833 µm）、α = 30°、λ = 840 nm：sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508，β ≈ 30.5°，cosβ ≈ 0.861。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 1200 line/mm grating (d = 0.833 µm) at α = 30° and λ = 840 nm gives sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508, β ≈ 30.5°, cosβ ≈ 0.861.","failure":"常見誤解：「光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光柵光譜儀與線型相機」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Grating spectrometer and line camera”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-13-k1","title":"光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化","titleEn":"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization","text":"光譜域 OCT 的光譜儀由準直鏡、繞射光柵、聚焦鏡與線型相機組成；光柵方程式 sinα + sinβ = mλ/d 給出偏向角，線色散 dλ/dx = d·cosβ/(m·f) 決定每個像素覆蓋的波長。相機像素在波長上等距，但傅立葉轉換需要在波數 k = 2π/λ 上等距，所以在轉換前必須重新取樣；省略這一步，點擴散函數會隨深度迅速變寬。","textEn":"The spectrometer of spectral-domain OCT consists of a collimator, a diffraction grating, a focusing lens and a line camera; the grating equation sinα + sinβ = mλ/d gives the diffraction angle and the linear dispersion dλ/dx = d·cosβ/(m·f) sets the wavelength per pixel. Camera pixels are equally spaced in wavelength but the Fourier transform needs equal spacing in wavenumber k = 2π/λ, so the data must be resampled before transforming; skipping this step broadens the point-spread function rapidly with depth.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization\" is correct?","options":["光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。","光譜域 OCT 的光譜儀由準直鏡、繞射光柵、聚焦鏡與線型相機組成。","增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution.","The spectrometer of spectral-domain OCT consists of a collimator, a diffraction grating, a focusing lens and a line camera.","Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power."],"answer":1,"explanation":"光譜域 OCT 的光譜儀由準直鏡、繞射光柵、聚焦鏡與線型相機組成；光柵方程式 sinα + sinβ = mλ/d 給出偏向角，線色散 dλ/dx = d·cosβ/(m·f) 決定每個像素覆蓋的波長。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The spectrometer of spectral-domain OCT consists of a collimator, a diffraction grating, a focusing lens and a line camera; the grating equation sinα + sinβ = mλ/d gives the diffraction angle and the linear dispersion dλ/dx = d·cosβ/(m·f) sets the wavelength per pixel. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a425-v12-14","title":"光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化：定量估算","titleEn":"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光柵光譜儀與線型相機」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Grating spectrometer and line camera” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：1200 線/mm 光柵（d = 0.833 µm）、α = 30°、λ = 840 nm：sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508，β ≈ 30.5°，cosβ ≈ 0.861。聚焦鏡 f = 200 mm 時 dλ/dx = 0.833×0.861/200 ≈ 3.59 nm/mm，14 µm 像素對應 0.050 nm，2048 像素覆蓋 103 nm，z_max ≈ 3.5 mm。波段兩端 790 與 890 nm 的 k 間距比為 (890/790)² ≈ 1.27，即 27% 的非線性必須重新取樣。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 1200 line/mm grating (d = 0.833 µm) at α = 30° and λ = 840 nm gives sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508, β ≈ 30.5°, cosβ ≈ 0.861. With a 200 mm focusing lens, dλ/dx = 0.833×0.861/200 ≈ 3.59 nm/mm, so a 14 µm pixel spans 0.050 nm, 2048 pixels cover 103 nm and z_max ≈ 3.5 mm. Between 790 and 890 nm the k spacing per pixel changes by (890/790)² ≈ 1.27, a 27% nonlinearity that must be resampled. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用已知譜線（例如氬或氖燈）或窄線寬雷射標定像素對波長的多項式，再把鏡面干涉圖直接轉換與重新取樣後轉換各做一次，比較不同深度的峰寬；正確線性化後峰寬應只隨衰減模型緩慢變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate the pixel-to-wavelength polynomial with known lines such as an argon or neon lamp or a narrow-linewidth laser, then transform a mirror interferogram once directly and once after resampling and compare peak widths at several depths; after correct linearization the width should change only slowly according to the roll-off model.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"1200 線/mm 光柵（d = 0.833 µm）、α = 30°、λ = 840 nm：sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508，β ≈ 30.5°，cosβ ≈ 0.861。聚焦鏡 f = 200 mm 時 dλ/dx = 0.833×0.861/200 ≈ 3.59 nm/mm，14 µm 像素對應 0.050 nm，2048 像素覆蓋 103 nm，z_max ≈ 3.5 mm。波段兩端 790 與 890 nm 的 k 間距比為 (890/790)² ≈ 1.27，即 27% 的非線性必須重新取樣。","textEn":"A 1200 line/mm grating (d = 0.833 µm) at α = 30° and λ = 840 nm gives sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508, β ≈ 30.5°, cosβ ≈ 0.861. With a 200 mm focusing lens, dλ/dx = 0.833×0.861/200 ≈ 3.59 nm/mm, so a 14 µm pixel spans 0.050 nm, 2048 pixels cover 103 nm and z_max ≈ 3.5 mm. Between 790 and 890 nm the k spacing per pixel changes by (890/790)² ≈ 1.27, a 27% nonlinearity that must be resampled.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization\", which statement holds?","options":["用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。","提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。","1200 線/mm 光柵（d = 0.833 µm）、α = 30°、λ = 840 nm：sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508，β ≈ 30.5°，cosβ ≈ 0.861。"],"optionsEn":["A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth.","Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution.","A 1200 line/mm grating (d = 0.833 µm) at α = 30° and λ = 840 nm gives sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508, β ≈ 30.5°, cosβ ≈ 0.861."],"answer":2,"explanation":"1200 線/mm 光柵（d = 0.833 µm）、α = 30°、λ = 840 nm：sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508，β ≈ 30.5°，cosβ ≈ 0.861。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 1200 line/mm grating (d = 0.833 µm) at α = 30° and λ = 840 nm gives sinβ = 1.008 − 0.5 = 0.508, β ≈ 30.5°, cosβ ≈ 0.861. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a425-v12-15","title":"光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光柵光譜儀與線型相機」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Grating spectrometer and line camera” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用已知譜線（例如氬或氖燈）或窄線寬雷射標定像素對波長的多項式，再把鏡面干涉圖直接轉換與重新取樣後轉換各做一次，比較不同深度的峰寬；正確線性化後峰寬應只隨衰減模型緩慢變化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate the pixel-to-wavelength polynomial with known lines such as an argon or neon lamp or a narrow-linewidth laser, then transform a mirror interferogram once directly and once after resampling and compare peak widths at several depths; after correct linearization the width should change only slowly according to the roll-off model. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：線型相機或光柵因溫度漂移使光譜在像素上平移半個像素，固定的 k 標定失效，深層峰值變寬且深度比例尺出現約 0.5% 的誤差，層厚量測系統性偏差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Thermal drift that shifts the spectrum by half a pixel on the camera or grating invalidates the fixed k calibration; deep peaks broaden and the depth scale acquires an error of about 0.5%, biasing every layer-thickness measurement.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用已知譜線（例如氬或氖燈）或窄線寬雷射標定像素對波長的多項式，再把鏡面干涉圖直接轉換與重新取樣後轉換各做一次，比較不同深度的峰寬；正確線性化後峰寬應只隨衰減模型緩慢變化。","textEn":"Calibrate the pixel-to-wavelength polynomial with known lines such as an argon or neon lamp or a narrow-linewidth laser, then transform a mirror interferogram once directly and once after resampling and compare peak widths at several depths; after correct linearization the width should change only slowly according to the roll-off model.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization\"?","options":["用已知譜線（例如氬或氖燈）或窄線寬雷射標定像素對波長的多項式，再把鏡面干涉圖直接轉換與重新取樣後轉換各做一次，比較不同深度的峰寬。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。"],"optionsEn":["Calibrate the pixel-to-wavelength polynomial with known lines such as an argon or neon lamp or a narrow-linewidth laser, then transform a mirror interferogram once directly and once after resampling and compare peak widths at several depths.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用已知譜線（例如氬或氖燈）或窄線寬雷射標定像素對波長的多項式，再把鏡面干涉圖直接轉換與重新取樣後轉換各做一次，比較不同深度的峰寬；正確線性化後峰寬應只隨衰減模型緩慢變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate the pixel-to-wavelength polynomial with known lines such as an argon or neon lamp or a narrow-linewidth laser, then transform a mirror interferogram once directly and once after resampling and compare peak widths at several depths; after correct linearization the width should change only slowly according to the roll-off model. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a425-v12-16","title":"光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化：失效診斷","titleEn":"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光柵光譜儀與線型相機」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Grating spectrometer and line camera” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"線型相機或光柵因溫度漂移使光譜在像素上平移半個像素，固定的 k 標定失效，深層峰值變寬且深度比例尺出現約 0.5% 的誤差，層厚量測系統性偏差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Thermal drift that shifts the spectrum by half a pixel on the camera or grating invalidates the fixed k calibration; deep peaks broaden and the depth scale acquires an error of about 0.5%, biasing every layer-thickness measurement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：光譜儀的聚焦品質決定 w 值，也就是衰減速率。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The focusing quality of the spectrometer sets w and therefore the roll-off rate.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"線型相機或光柵因溫度漂移使光譜在像素上平移半個像素，固定的 k 標定失效，深層峰值變寬且深度比例尺出現約 0.5% 的誤差，層厚量測系統性偏差。","textEn":"Thermal drift that shifts the spectrum by half a pixel on the camera or grating invalidates the fixed k calibration; deep peaks broaden and the depth scale acquires an error of about 0.5%, biasing every layer-thickness measurement.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光譜儀色散、像素取樣與 k 線性化」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Spectrometer dispersion, pixel sampling and k-linearization\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","線型相機或光柵因溫度漂移使光譜在像素上平移半個像素，固定的 k 標定失效，深層峰值變寬且深度比例尺出現約 0.5% 的誤差，層厚量測系統性偏差。","增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Thermal drift that shifts the spectrum by half a pixel on the camera or grating invalidates the fixed k calibration.","Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power."],"answer":1,"explanation":"線型相機或光柵因溫度漂移使光譜在像素上平移半個像素，固定的 k 標定失效，深層峰值變寬且深度比例尺出現約 0.5% 的誤差，層厚量測系統性偏差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Thermal drift that shifts the spectrum by half a pixel on the camera or grating invalidates the fixed k calibration; deep peaks broaden and the depth scale acquires an error of about 0.5%, biasing every layer-thickness measurement. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a425-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算」與「兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget\" and \"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a425-v12-17","title":"靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「散粒雜訊極限與靈敏度量測」如何決定光學同調斷層掃描的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Shot-noise limit and sensitivity measurement” determines the key performance of “Optical coherence tomography”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"靈敏度定義為能以信噪比 1 偵測的最小樣品反射率，常以 dB 表示。當參考光足夠強使散粒雜訊主導時，靈敏度極限只取決於樣品臂回到偵測器的光子數：功率乘上曝光時間、除以光子能量、再乘上偵測效率。實際系統因耦合器分光、光譜儀效率與相機量子效率而低於極限數 dB，差距就是損耗預算；更高的 A 掃描速率縮短曝光時間，靈敏度按比例下降。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「散粒雜訊極限與靈敏度量測」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Sensitivity is the smallest sample reflectivity detectable at unit signal-to-noise ratio, usually quoted in dB. When the reference beam is strong enough for shot noise to dominate, the limit depends only on the number of sample-arm photons reaching the detector: power times exposure time divided by photon energy, times detection efficiency. Real systems fall a few dB short because of coupler splitting, spectrometer efficiency and camera quantum efficiency, and that gap is the loss budget; higher A-scan rates shorten the exposure and lower sensitivity proportionally. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Shot-noise limit and sensitivity measurement”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：散粒雜訊極限 Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph：P_s = 0.7 mW、τ = 14.3 µs（70 kHz A 掃描）、E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J、η = 0.8 時，光子數 ≈ 4.2×10¹⁰，Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰ → 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Shot-noise limit Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph: with P_s = 0.7 mW, τ = 14.3 µs (70 kHz A-scan rate), E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J and η = 0.8, the photon number is about 4.2×10¹⁰ and Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰, i.e. 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB.","failure":"常見誤解：「增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「散粒雜訊極限與靈敏度量測」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Shot-noise limit and sensitivity measurement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-17-k1","title":"靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算","titleEn":"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget","text":"靈敏度定義為能以信噪比 1 偵測的最小樣品反射率，常以 dB 表示。當參考光足夠強使散粒雜訊主導時，靈敏度極限只取決於樣品臂回到偵測器的光子數：功率乘上曝光時間、除以光子能量、再乘上偵測效率。","textEn":"Sensitivity is the smallest sample reflectivity detectable at unit signal-to-noise ratio, usually quoted in dB. When the reference beam is strong enough for shot noise to dominate, the limit depends only on the number of sample-arm photons reaching the detector: power times exposure time divided by photon energy, times detection efficiency.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget\" is correct?","options":["增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。","只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。","靈敏度定義為能以信噪比 1 偵測的最小樣品反射率，常以 dB 表示。"],"optionsEn":["Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power.","Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion.","Sensitivity is the smallest sample reflectivity detectable at unit signal-to-noise ratio, usually quoted in dB."],"answer":2,"explanation":"靈敏度定義為能以信噪比 1 偵測的最小樣品反射率，常以 dB 表示。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Sensitivity is the smallest sample reflectivity detectable at unit signal-to-noise ratio, usually quoted in dB. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a425-v12-18","title":"靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「散粒雜訊極限與靈敏度量測」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Shot-noise limit and sensitivity measurement” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：散粒雜訊極限 Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph：P_s = 0.7 mW、τ = 14.3 µs（70 kHz A 掃描）、E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J、η = 0.8 時，光子數 ≈ 4.2×10¹⁰，Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰ → 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB。實測 98 dB 表示有 7 dB 損耗，其中 50/50 耦合器雙程約 6 dB，其餘歸於光譜儀效率；提高到 140 kHz 則極限再降 3 dB。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Shot-noise limit Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph: with P_s = 0.7 mW, τ = 14.3 µs (70 kHz A-scan rate), E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J and η = 0.8, the photon number is about 4.2×10¹⁰ and Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰, i.e. 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB. A measured 98 dB implies a 7 dB loss, of which the double pass through a 50/50 coupler accounts for about 6 dB and the rest for spectrometer efficiency; doubling the rate to 140 kHz lowers the limit by 3 dB. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：樣品臂放鏡子並加一片 OD 2 中性濾鏡（雙程 −40 dB），量峰值高於雜訊底的 dB 數再加 40 dB 得靈敏度；與散粒雜訊極限比較，並以功率計逐段量測耦合器、光纖與光譜儀的損耗，確認差距可被損耗預算解釋。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Put a mirror in the sample arm behind an OD 2 neutral-density filter (−40 dB double pass), read the peak above the noise floor in dB and add 40 dB to obtain sensitivity; compare with the shot-noise limit and measure coupler, fibre and spectrometer losses stage by stage with a power meter to confirm the gap matches the loss budget.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"散粒雜訊極限 Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph：P_s = 0.7 mW、τ = 14.3 µs（70 kHz A 掃描）、E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J、η = 0.8 時，光子數 ≈ 4.2×10¹⁰，Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰ → 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB。實測 98 dB 表示有 7 dB 損耗，其中 50/50 耦合器雙程約 6 dB，其餘歸於光譜儀效率；提高到 140 kHz 則極限再降 3 dB。","textEn":"Shot-noise limit Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph: with P_s = 0.7 mW, τ = 14.3 µs (70 kHz A-scan rate), E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J and η = 0.8, the photon number is about 4.2×10¹⁰ and Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰, i.e. 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB. A measured 98 dB implies a 7 dB loss, of which the double pass through a 50/50 coupler accounts for about 6 dB and the rest for spectrometer efficiency; doubling the rate to 140 kHz lowers the limit by 3 dB.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget\", which statement holds?","options":["散粒雜訊極限 Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph：P_s = 0.7 mW、τ = 14.3 µs（70 kHz A 掃描）、E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J、η = 0.8 時，光子數 ≈ 4.2×10¹⁰，Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰ → 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB。","影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。","頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。"],"optionsEn":["Shot-noise limit Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph: with P_s = 0.7 mW, τ = 14.3 µs (70 kHz A-scan rate), E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J and η = 0.8, the photon number is about 4.2×10¹⁰ and Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰, i.e. 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB.","A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed.","In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue."],"answer":0,"explanation":"散粒雜訊極限 Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph：P_s = 0.7 mW、τ = 14.3 µs（70 kHz A 掃描）、E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J、η = 0.8 時，光子數 ≈ 4.2×10¹⁰，Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰ → 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Shot-noise limit Σ = η·P_s·τ/E_ph: with P_s = 0.7 mW, τ = 14.3 µs (70 kHz A-scan rate), E_ph = 2.36×10⁻¹⁹ J and η = 0.8, the photon number is about 4.2×10¹⁰ and Σ ≈ 3.4×10¹⁰, i.e. 10·log₁₀ ≈ 105 dB. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a425-v12-19","title":"靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「散粒雜訊極限與靈敏度量測」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Shot-noise limit and sensitivity measurement” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"樣品臂放鏡子並加一片 OD 2 中性濾鏡（雙程 −40 dB），量峰值高於雜訊底的 dB 數再加 40 dB 得靈敏度；與散粒雜訊極限比較，並以功率計逐段量測耦合器、光纖與光譜儀的損耗，確認差距可被損耗預算解釋。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Put a mirror in the sample arm behind an OD 2 neutral-density filter (−40 dB double pass), read the peak above the noise floor in dB and add 40 dB to obtain sensitivity; compare with the shot-noise limit and measure coupler, fibre and spectrometer losses stage by stage with a power meter to confirm the gap matches the loss budget. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：參考光太強使相機飽和或進入過量雜訊區，或太弱使讀出雜訊主導，兩者都讓靈敏度偏離散粒雜訊極限 5 到 10 dB，深層弱散射組織消失在雜訊底之下。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A reference beam strong enough to saturate the camera or enter the excess-noise regime, or weak enough for read noise to dominate, pushes sensitivity 5 to 10 dB away from the shot-noise limit, and weakly scattering deep tissue disappears below the noise floor.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"樣品臂放鏡子並加一片 OD 2 中性濾鏡（雙程 −40 dB），量峰值高於雜訊底的 dB 數再加 40 dB 得靈敏度；與散粒雜訊極限比較，並以功率計逐段量測耦合器、光纖與光譜儀的損耗，確認差距可被損耗預算解釋。","textEn":"Put a mirror in the sample arm behind an OD 2 neutral-density filter (−40 dB double pass), read the peak above the noise floor in dB and add 40 dB to obtain sensitivity; compare with the shot-noise limit and measure coupler, fibre and spectrometer losses stage by stage with a power meter to confirm the gap matches the loss budget.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","樣品臂放鏡子並加一片 OD 2 中性濾鏡（雙程 −40 dB），量峰值高於雜訊底的 dB 數再加 40 dB 得靈敏度。","光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Put a mirror in the sample arm behind an OD 2 neutral-density filter (−40 dB double pass), read the peak above the noise floor in dB and add 40 dB to obtain sensitivity.","A broader source always gives a better image at every depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"樣品臂放鏡子並加一片 OD 2 中性濾鏡（雙程 −40 dB），量峰值高於雜訊底的 dB 數再加 40 dB 得靈敏度；與散粒雜訊極限比較，並以功率計逐段量測耦合器、光纖與光譜儀的損耗，確認差距可被損耗預算解釋。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Put a mirror in the sample arm behind an OD 2 neutral-density filter (−40 dB double pass), read the peak above the noise floor in dB and add 40 dB to obtain sensitivity; compare with the shot-noise limit and measure coupler, fibre and spectrometer losses stage by stage with a power meter to confirm the gap matches the loss budget. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a425-v12-20","title":"靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「散粒雜訊極限與靈敏度量測」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Shot-noise limit and sensitivity measurement” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"參考光太強使相機飽和或進入過量雜訊區，或太弱使讀出雜訊主導，兩者都讓靈敏度偏離散粒雜訊極限 5 到 10 dB，深層弱散射組織消失在雜訊底之下。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A reference beam strong enough to saturate the camera or enter the excess-noise regime, or weak enough for read noise to dominate, pushes sensitivity 5 to 10 dB away from the shot-noise limit, and weakly scattering deep tissue disappears below the noise floor. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：實際系統因耦合器分光、光譜儀效率與相機量子效率而低於極限數 dB，差距就是損耗預算；更高的 A 掃描速率縮短曝光時間，靈敏度按比例下降。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Real systems fall a few dB short because of coupler splitting, spectrometer efficiency and camera quantum efficiency, and that gap is the loss budget; higher A-scan rates shorten the exposure and lower sensitivity proportionally.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"參考光太強使相機飽和或進入過量雜訊區，或太弱使讀出雜訊主導，兩者都讓靈敏度偏離散粒雜訊極限 5 到 10 dB，深層弱散射組織消失在雜訊底之下。","textEn":"A reference beam strong enough to saturate the camera or enter the excess-noise regime, or weak enough for read noise to dominate, pushes sensitivity 5 to 10 dB away from the shot-noise limit, and weakly scattering deep tissue disappears below the noise floor.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「靈敏度、散粒雜訊極限與功率預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sensitivity, shot-noise limit and power budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。","參考光太強使相機飽和或進入過量雜訊區，或太弱使讀出雜訊主導，兩者都讓靈敏度偏離散粒雜訊極限 5 到 10 dB，深層弱散射組織消失在雜訊底之下。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion.","A reference beam strong enough to saturate the camera or enter the excess-noise regime, or weak enough for read noise to dominate, pushes sensitivity 5 to 10 dB away from the shot-noise limit, and weakly scattering deep tissue disappears below the noise floor."],"answer":2,"explanation":"參考光太強使相機飽和或進入過量雜訊區，或太弱使讀出雜訊主導，兩者都讓靈敏度偏離散粒雜訊極限 5 到 10 dB，深層弱散射組織消失在雜訊底之下。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A reference beam strong enough to saturate the camera or enter the excess-noise regime, or weak enough for read noise to dominate, pushes sensitivity 5 to 10 dB away from the shot-noise limit, and weakly scattering deep tissue disappears below the noise floor. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a425-v12-21","title":"兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「色散補償玻璃與點擴散函數」如何決定光學同調斷層掃描的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Dispersion-compensation glass and PSF” determines the key performance of “Optical coherence tomography”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"參考臂與樣品臂若通過不同長度的玻璃、光纖或水，群速度色散會在干涉光譜上加入二次相位，使同調包絡像被啁啾的脈衝一樣展寬，軸向解析度變差且峰值下降。補償方法是在參考臂放入等效材料與長度的玻璃或水槽，或在重建時用數值方式乘上反向的二次相位並以峰值銳度最佳化係數。解析度預算需把光源頻寬實測值、殘留色散與光譜儀 k 標定誤差逐項列入。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「色散補償玻璃與點擴散函數」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"If reference and sample arms traverse different lengths of glass, fibre or water, group-velocity dispersion adds a quadratic phase across the interference spectrum, broadening the coherence envelope like a chirped pulse and lowering the peak. Compensation places glass or a water cell of equivalent material and length in the reference arm, or numerically multiplies by the inverse quadratic phase with coefficients optimized for peak sharpness. The resolution budget must list the measured source bandwidth, residual dispersion and the spectrometer k-calibration error item by item. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Dispersion-compensation glass and PSF”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：δz = 6.2 µm 對應雙程包絡寬度 12.4 µm，即 τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: δz = 6.2 µm corresponds to a double-pass envelope of 12.4 µm, i.e. τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「色散補償玻璃與點擴散函數」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Dispersion-compensation glass and PSF”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-21-k1","title":"兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算","titleEn":"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget","text":"參考臂與樣品臂若通過不同長度的玻璃、光纖或水，群速度色散會在干涉光譜上加入二次相位，使同調包絡像被啁啾的脈衝一樣展寬，軸向解析度變差且峰值下降。補償方法是在參考臂放入等效材料與長度的玻璃或水槽，或在重建時用數值方式乘上反向的二次相位並以峰值銳度最佳化係數。","textEn":"If reference and sample arms traverse different lengths of glass, fibre or water, group-velocity dispersion adds a quadratic phase across the interference spectrum, broadening the coherence envelope like a chirped pulse and lowering the peak. Compensation places glass or a water cell of equivalent material and length in the reference arm, or numerically multiplies by the inverse quadratic phase with coefficients optimized for peak sharpness.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget\" is correct?","options":["參考臂與樣品臂若通過不同長度的玻璃、光纖或水，群速度色散會在干涉光譜上加入二次相位，使同調包絡像被啁啾的脈衝一樣展寬，軸向解析度變差且峰值下降。","只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。","用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。"],"optionsEn":["If reference and sample arms traverse different lengths of glass, fibre or water, group-velocity dispersion adds a quadratic phase across the interference spectrum, broadening the coherence envelope like a chirped pulse and lowering the peak.","Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion.","A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth."],"answer":0,"explanation":"參考臂與樣品臂若通過不同長度的玻璃、光纖或水，群速度色散會在干涉光譜上加入二次相位，使同調包絡像被啁啾的脈衝一樣展寬，軸向解析度變差且峰值下降。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"If reference and sample arms traverse different lengths of glass, fibre or water, group-velocity dispersion adds a quadratic phase across the interference spectrum, broadening the coherence envelope like a chirped pulse and lowering the peak. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a425-v12-22","title":"兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「色散補償玻璃與點擴散函數」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Dispersion-compensation glass and PSF” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：δz = 6.2 µm 對應雙程包絡寬度 12.4 µm，即 τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs。樣品臂多出 20 mm BK7（840 nm 群速度色散取約 40 fs²/mm）雙程產生 φ₂ ≈ 1600 fs²，包絡展寬為 τ = τ₀·√(1 + (4ln2·φ₂/τ₀²)²) = 41.5×√(1 + 2.58²) ≈ 115 fs，δz 變為約 17 µm，差 2.8 倍；補償到殘留 100 fs² 時展寬僅 1.3%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: δz = 6.2 µm corresponds to a double-pass envelope of 12.4 µm, i.e. τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs. An extra 20 mm of BK7 in the sample arm (group-velocity dispersion taken as about 40 fs²/mm at 840 nm) gives φ₂ ≈ 1600 fs² over the double pass, broadening the envelope to τ = τ₀·√(1 + (4ln2·φ₂/τ₀²)²) = 41.5×√(1 + 2.58²) ≈ 115 fs, so δz grows to about 17 µm, 2.8 times worse; compensating to a residual of 100 fs² leaves only 1.3% broadening. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以鏡面點擴散函數為指標，逐步加入補償玻璃或調整數值二次相位係數，記錄峰寬與峰高隨補償量的曲線，取峰寬最小處為匹配點；再在數個深度重複，確認殘留三次色散不造成峰形不對稱。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use the mirror point-spread function as the metric, add compensation glass or adjust the numerical quadratic-phase coefficient step by step, record peak width and height against compensation, and take the minimum width as the match point; repeat at several depths to confirm that residual third-order dispersion does not skew the peak.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"δz = 6.2 µm 對應雙程包絡寬度 12.4 µm，即 τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs。樣品臂多出 20 mm BK7（840 nm 群速度色散取約 40 fs²/mm）雙程產生 φ₂ ≈ 1600 fs²，包絡展寬為 τ = τ₀·√(1 + (4ln2·φ₂/τ₀²)²) = 41.5×√(1 + 2.58²) ≈ 115 fs，δz 變為約 17 µm，差 2.8 倍；補償到殘留 100 fs² 時展寬僅 1.3%。","textEn":"δz = 6.2 µm corresponds to a double-pass envelope of 12.4 µm, i.e. τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs. An extra 20 mm of BK7 in the sample arm (group-velocity dispersion taken as about 40 fs²/mm at 840 nm) gives φ₂ ≈ 1600 fs² over the double pass, broadening the envelope to τ = τ₀·√(1 + (4ln2·φ₂/τ₀²)²) = 41.5×√(1 + 2.58²) ≈ 115 fs, so δz grows to about 17 µm, 2.8 times worse; compensating to a residual of 100 fs² leaves only 1.3% broadening.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget\", which statement holds?","options":["提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。","δz = 6.2 µm 對應雙程包絡寬度 12.4 µm，即 τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs。","光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution.","δz = 6.2 µm corresponds to a double-pass envelope of 12.4 µm, i.e. τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs.","A broader source always gives a better image at every depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"δz = 6.2 µm 對應雙程包絡寬度 12.4 µm，即 τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"δz = 6.2 µm corresponds to a double-pass envelope of 12.4 µm, i.e. τ₀ ≈ 41.5 fs. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a425-v12-23","title":"兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「色散補償玻璃與點擴散函數」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Dispersion-compensation glass and PSF” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以鏡面點擴散函數為指標，逐步加入補償玻璃或調整數值二次相位係數，記錄峰寬與峰高隨補償量的曲線，取峰寬最小處為匹配點；再在數個深度重複，確認殘留三次色散不造成峰形不對稱。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use the mirror point-spread function as the metric, add compensation glass or adjust the numerical quadratic-phase coefficient step by step, record peak width and height against compensation, and take the minimum width as the match point; repeat at several depths to confirm that residual third-order dispersion does not skew the peak. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只在零深度最佳化數值色散補償，卻忽略樣品本身（例如 24 mm 眼軸的水）的色散，視網膜層的點擴散函數比角膜處寬兩倍以上，層厚量測失準。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Optimizing numerical dispersion compensation only at zero depth while ignoring the sample's own dispersion, such as the 24 mm of water in an eye, leaves the retinal point-spread function more than twice as wide as at the cornea and corrupts layer-thickness measurements.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以鏡面點擴散函數為指標，逐步加入補償玻璃或調整數值二次相位係數，記錄峰寬與峰高隨補償量的曲線，取峰寬最小處為匹配點；再在數個深度重複，確認殘留三次色散不造成峰形不對稱。","textEn":"Use the mirror point-spread function as the metric, add compensation glass or adjust the numerical quadratic-phase coefficient step by step, record peak width and height against compensation, and take the minimum width as the match point; repeat at several depths to confirm that residual third-order dispersion does not skew the peak.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。","以鏡面點擴散函數為指標，逐步加入補償玻璃或調整數值二次相位係數，記錄峰寬與峰高隨補償量的曲線，取峰寬最小處為匹配點。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution.","Use the mirror point-spread function as the metric, add compensation glass or adjust the numerical quadratic-phase coefficient step by step, record peak width and height against compensation, and take the minimum width as the match point."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以鏡面點擴散函數為指標，逐步加入補償玻璃或調整數值二次相位係數，記錄峰寬與峰高隨補償量的曲線，取峰寬最小處為匹配點；再在數個深度重複，確認殘留三次色散不造成峰形不對稱。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use the mirror point-spread function as the metric, add compensation glass or adjust the numerical quadratic-phase coefficient step by step, record peak width and height against compensation, and take the minimum width as the match point; repeat at several depths to confirm that residual third-order dispersion does not skew the peak. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a425-v12-24","title":"兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「色散補償玻璃與點擴散函數」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Dispersion-compensation glass and PSF” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只在零深度最佳化數值色散補償，卻忽略樣品本身（例如 24 mm 眼軸的水）的色散，視網膜層的點擴散函數比角膜處寬兩倍以上，層厚量測失準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Optimizing numerical dispersion compensation only at zero depth while ignoring the sample's own dispersion, such as the 24 mm of water in an eye, leaves the retinal point-spread function more than twice as wide as at the cornea and corrupts layer-thickness measurements. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：解析度預算需把光源頻寬實測值、殘留色散與光譜儀 k 標定誤差逐項列入。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The resolution budget must list the measured source bandwidth, residual dispersion and the spectrometer k-calibration error item by item.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只在零深度最佳化數值色散補償，卻忽略樣品本身（例如 24 mm 眼軸的水）的色散，視網膜層的點擴散函數比角膜處寬兩倍以上，層厚量測失準。","textEn":"Optimizing numerical dispersion compensation only at zero depth while ignoring the sample's own dispersion, such as the 24 mm of water in an eye, leaves the retinal point-spread function more than twice as wide as at the cornea and corrupts layer-thickness measurements.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「兩臂色散匹配與解析度誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Arm dispersion matching and the resolution error budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只在零深度最佳化數值色散補償，卻忽略樣品本身（例如 24 mm 眼軸的水）的色散，視網膜層的點擴散函數比角膜處寬兩倍以上，層厚量測失準。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。"],"optionsEn":["Optimizing numerical dispersion compensation only at zero depth while ignoring the sample's own dispersion, such as the 24 mm of water in an eye, leaves the retinal point-spread function more than twice as wide as at the cornea and corrupts layer-thickness measurements.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth."],"answer":0,"explanation":"只在零深度最佳化數值色散補償，卻忽略樣品本身（例如 24 mm 眼軸的水）的色散，視網膜層的點擴散函數比角膜處寬兩倍以上，層厚量測失準。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Optimizing numerical dispersion compensation only at zero depth while ignoring the sample's own dispersion, such as the 24 mm of water in an eye, leaves the retinal point-spread function more than twice as wide as at the cornea and corrupts layer-thickness measurements. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a425-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序」與「深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing\" and \"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a425-v12-25","title":"掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「振鏡掃描與眼底成像光學」如何決定光學同調斷層掃描的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Galvo scanner and retinal imaging optics” determines the key performance of “Optical coherence tomography”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"樣品臂以一對振鏡在物鏡（眼底成像時是眼睛本身）的瞳孔共軛面上偏轉光束，掃描透鏡與中繼光學把偏轉角轉成視網膜上的位置。光斑大小由入瞳光束直徑與焦距決定，必須刻意保持低數值孔徑，讓焦深覆蓋整個感興趣的深度；橫向取樣間距需小於光斑的一半，否則細節混疊。A 掃描速率、每幅 B 掃描的 A 掃描數與體積大小共同決定擷取時間，而受測者的眼動限制了可接受的時間。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「振鏡掃描與眼底成像光學」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The sample arm deflects the beam with a galvanometer pair at a pupil-conjugate plane of the objective, which for retinal imaging is the eye itself, and the scan lens and relay optics convert angle into position on the retina. Spot size follows from the entrance-beam diameter and focal length, and the numerical aperture is deliberately kept low so that the depth of focus spans the whole depth of interest; lateral sampling must be finer than half the spot or detail aliases. A-scan rate, A-scans per B-scan and volume size set acquisition time, which subject eye motion bounds. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Galvo scanner and retinal imaging optics”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：眼睛 f ≈ 17 mm、角膜處光束直徑 d = 1.2 mm、λ₀ = 840 nm：光斑 Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm，w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm，焦深 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm，足以涵蓋約 0.3 mm 厚的視網膜。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For an eye with f ≈ 17 mm, a 1.2 mm beam at the cornea and λ₀ = 840 nm, the spot is Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm, w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm, and the depth of focus 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm covers the roughly 0.3 mm thick retina.","failure":"常見誤解：「用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「振鏡掃描與眼底成像光學」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Galvo scanner and retinal imaging optics”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-25-k1","title":"掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序","titleEn":"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing","text":"樣品臂以一對振鏡在物鏡（眼底成像時是眼睛本身）的瞳孔共軛面上偏轉光束，掃描透鏡與中繼光學把偏轉角轉成視網膜上的位置。光斑大小由入瞳光束直徑與焦距決定，必須刻意保持低數值孔徑，讓焦深覆蓋整個感興趣的深度；橫向取樣間距需小於光斑的一半，否則細節混疊。","textEn":"The sample arm deflects the beam with a galvanometer pair at a pupil-conjugate plane of the objective, which for retinal imaging is the eye itself, and the scan lens and relay optics convert angle into position on the retina. Spot size follows from the entrance-beam diameter and focal length, and the numerical aperture is deliberately kept low so that the depth of focus spans the whole depth of interest; lateral sampling must be finer than half the spot or detail aliases.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing\" is correct?","options":["用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。","樣品臂以一對振鏡在物鏡（眼底成像時是眼睛本身）的瞳孔共軛面上偏轉光束，掃描透鏡與中繼光學把偏轉角轉成視網膜上的位置。","影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。"],"optionsEn":["A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth.","The sample arm deflects the beam with a galvanometer pair at a pupil-conjugate plane of the objective, which for retinal imaging is the eye itself, and the scan lens and relay optics convert angle into position on the retina.","A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"樣品臂以一對振鏡在物鏡（眼底成像時是眼睛本身）的瞳孔共軛面上偏轉光束，掃描透鏡與中繼光學把偏轉角轉成視網膜上的位置。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The sample arm deflects the beam with a galvanometer pair at a pupil-conjugate plane of the objective, which for retinal imaging is the eye itself, and the scan lens and relay optics convert angle into position on the retina. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a425-v12-26","title":"掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序：定量估算","titleEn":"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「振鏡掃描與眼底成像光學」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Galvo scanner and retinal imaging optics” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：眼睛 f ≈ 17 mm、角膜處光束直徑 d = 1.2 mm、λ₀ = 840 nm：光斑 Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm，w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm，焦深 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm，足以涵蓋約 0.3 mm 厚的視網膜。70 kHz 下 512 條 A 掃描的 B 掃描需 7.3 ms，512×512 體積需 3.7 s；6 mm 掃描寬度分 512 條時間距 11.7 µm 接近光斑，要達奈奎斯特取樣應用 1024 條。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For an eye with f ≈ 17 mm, a 1.2 mm beam at the cornea and λ₀ = 840 nm, the spot is Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm, w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm, and the depth of focus 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm covers the roughly 0.3 mm thick retina. At 70 kHz a 512-A-scan B-scan takes 7.3 ms and a 512×512 volume 3.7 s; a 6 mm scan with 512 lines has an 11.7 µm pitch close to the spot, so Nyquist sampling calls for 1024 lines. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用已知線距的光柵或刻度標板校正振鏡角度對位置的比例與線性度，用次解析度散射點量橫向點擴散函數並與 Δx 比較；再以固定相位目標記錄多幅 B 掃描，統計振鏡回程與時序抖動造成的位置重複性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate the galvanometer angle-to-position scale and linearity with a grating or ruled target of known pitch, measure the lateral point-spread function with sub-resolution scatterers and compare with Δx; then record repeated B-scans of a fixed target and quantify positional repeatability from galvanometer fly-back and timing jitter.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"眼睛 f ≈ 17 mm、角膜處光束直徑 d = 1.2 mm、λ₀ = 840 nm：光斑 Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm，w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm，焦深 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm，足以涵蓋約 0.3 mm 厚的視網膜。70 kHz 下 512 條 A 掃描的 B 掃描需 7.3 ms，512×512 體積需 3.7 s；6 mm 掃描寬度分 512 條時間距 11.7 µm 接近光斑，要達奈奎斯特取樣應用 1024 條。","textEn":"For an eye with f ≈ 17 mm, a 1.2 mm beam at the cornea and λ₀ = 840 nm, the spot is Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm, w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm, and the depth of focus 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm covers the roughly 0.3 mm thick retina. At 70 kHz a 512-A-scan B-scan takes 7.3 ms and a 512×512 volume 3.7 s; a 6 mm scan with 512 lines has an 11.7 µm pitch close to the spot, so Nyquist sampling calls for 1024 lines.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing\", which statement holds?","options":["頻域 OCT 的影像深度只受光在組織中的穿透限制。","光譜儀像素越多，深度解析度就越高。","眼睛 f ≈ 17 mm、角膜處光束直徑 d = 1.2 mm、λ₀ = 840 nm：光斑 Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm，w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm，焦深 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm，足以涵蓋約 0.3 mm 厚的視網膜。"],"optionsEn":["In Fourier-domain OCT the imaging depth is limited only by light penetration into tissue.","More spectrometer pixels give finer depth resolution.","For an eye with f ≈ 17 mm, a 1.2 mm beam at the cornea and λ₀ = 840 nm, the spot is Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm, w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm, and the depth of focus 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm covers the roughly 0.3 mm thick retina."],"answer":2,"explanation":"眼睛 f ≈ 17 mm、角膜處光束直徑 d = 1.2 mm、λ₀ = 840 nm：光斑 Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm，w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm，焦深 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm，足以涵蓋約 0.3 mm 厚的視網膜。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For an eye with f ≈ 17 mm, a 1.2 mm beam at the cornea and λ₀ = 840 nm, the spot is Δx = (4/π)·λ₀·f/d ≈ 15 µm, w₀ ≈ 7.6 µm, and the depth of focus 2z_R = 2π·w₀²/λ₀ ≈ 0.43 mm covers the roughly 0.3 mm thick retina. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a425-v12-27","title":"掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「振鏡掃描與眼底成像光學」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Galvo scanner and retinal imaging optics” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用已知線距的光柵或刻度標板校正振鏡角度對位置的比例與線性度，用次解析度散射點量橫向點擴散函數並與 Δx 比較；再以固定相位目標記錄多幅 B 掃描，統計振鏡回程與時序抖動造成的位置重複性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate the galvanometer angle-to-position scale and linearity with a grating or ruled target of known pitch, measure the lateral point-spread function with sub-resolution scatterers and compare with Δx; then record repeated B-scans of a fixed target and quantify positional repeatability from galvanometer fly-back and timing jitter. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：振鏡與相機觸發不同步時，相鄰 B 掃描橫向錯位，體積影像出現鋸齒；掃描軸心偏離瞳孔共軛面則光束在角膜處掃過邊緣被切，視場邊緣訊號下降並出現暈影。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If galvanometer motion and camera triggers are not synchronized, adjacent B-scans shift laterally and the volume shows a sawtooth; a scan pivot displaced from the pupil-conjugate plane lets the beam walk across the corneal edge and be clipped, so signal falls and vignetting appears at the field edge.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用已知線距的光柵或刻度標板校正振鏡角度對位置的比例與線性度，用次解析度散射點量橫向點擴散函數並與 Δx 比較；再以固定相位目標記錄多幅 B 掃描，統計振鏡回程與時序抖動造成的位置重複性。","textEn":"Calibrate the galvanometer angle-to-position scale and linearity with a grating or ruled target of known pitch, measure the lateral point-spread function with sub-resolution scatterers and compare with Δx; then record repeated B-scans of a fixed target and quantify positional repeatability from galvanometer fly-back and timing jitter.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing\"?","options":["用已知線距的光柵或刻度標板校正振鏡角度對位置的比例與線性度，用次解析度散射點量橫向點擴散函數並與 Δx 比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["Calibrate the galvanometer angle-to-position scale and linearity with a grating or ruled target of known pitch, measure the lateral point-spread function with sub-resolution scatterers and compare with Δx.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用已知線距的光柵或刻度標板校正振鏡角度對位置的比例與線性度，用次解析度散射點量橫向點擴散函數並與 Δx 比較；再以固定相位目標記錄多幅 B 掃描，統計振鏡回程與時序抖動造成的位置重複性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate the galvanometer angle-to-position scale and linearity with a grating or ruled target of known pitch, measure the lateral point-spread function with sub-resolution scatterers and compare with Δx; then record repeated B-scans of a fixed target and quantify positional repeatability from galvanometer fly-back and timing jitter. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a425-v12-28","title":"掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「振鏡掃描與眼底成像光學」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Galvo scanner and retinal imaging optics” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"振鏡與相機觸發不同步時，相鄰 B 掃描橫向錯位，體積影像出現鋸齒；掃描軸心偏離瞳孔共軛面則光束在角膜處掃過邊緣被切，視場邊緣訊號下降並出現暈影。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If galvanometer motion and camera triggers are not synchronized, adjacent B-scans shift laterally and the volume shows a sawtooth; a scan pivot displaced from the pupil-conjugate plane lets the beam walk across the corneal edge and be clipped, so signal falls and vignetting appears at the field edge. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：A 掃描速率、每幅 B 掃描的 A 掃描數與體積大小共同決定擷取時間，而受測者的眼動限制了可接受的時間。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A-scan rate, A-scans per B-scan and volume size set acquisition time, which subject eye motion bounds.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「用更高數值孔徑聚焦，OCT 影像在所有深度都會更清晰。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A higher-NA focus makes OCT images sharper at every depth.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"振鏡與相機觸發不同步時，相鄰 B 掃描橫向錯位，體積影像出現鋸齒；掃描軸心偏離瞳孔共軛面則光束在角膜處掃過邊緣被切，視場邊緣訊號下降並出現暈影。","textEn":"If galvanometer motion and camera triggers are not synchronized, adjacent B-scans shift laterally and the volume shows a sawtooth; a scan pivot displaced from the pupil-conjugate plane lets the beam walk across the corneal edge and be clipped, so signal falls and vignetting appears at the field edge.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「掃描光學、取樣與體積成像時序」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scanning optics, sampling and volumetric timing\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","振鏡與相機觸發不同步時，相鄰 B 掃描橫向錯位，體積影像出現鋸齒；掃描軸心偏離瞳孔共軛面則光束在角膜處掃過邊緣被切，視場邊緣訊號下降並出現暈影。","影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","If galvanometer motion and camera triggers are not synchronized, adjacent B-scans shift laterally and the volume shows a sawtooth.","A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"振鏡與相機觸發不同步時，相鄰 B 掃描橫向錯位，體積影像出現鋸齒；掃描軸心偏離瞳孔共軛面則光束在角膜處掃過邊緣被切，視場邊緣訊號下降並出現暈影。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If galvanometer motion and camera triggers are not synchronized, adjacent B-scans shift laterally and the volume shows a sawtooth; a scan pivot displaced from the pupil-conjugate plane lets the beam walk across the corneal edge and be clipped, so signal falls and vignetting appears at the field edge. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a425-v12-29","title":"深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「深度比例尺假體與驗收報告」如何決定光學同調斷層掃描的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Depth-scale phantom and acceptance record” determines the key performance of “Optical coherence tomography”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"驗收必須證明深度軸可追溯：用已知厚度與群折射率的玻璃片量其在影像中的像素數，與理論光學厚度比較，確認每像素深度與線性度；用鏡面與中性濾鏡量靈敏度與衰減曲線；用散射假體確認在深度上的點擴散函數與對比。交接文件要記錄光源光譜、k 標定多項式、色散補償係數、掃描比例與所有驗收數據，讓日後任何重建都能重現。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「深度比例尺假體與驗收報告」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Acceptance must prove that the depth axis is traceable: measure the pixel count of a glass plate of known thickness and group index, compare with its theoretical optical thickness to confirm depth per pixel and linearity; measure sensitivity and the roll-off curve with a mirror and neutral-density filters; and confirm point-spread function and contrast versus depth with a scattering phantom. The handoff record stores the source spectrum, the k-calibration polynomial, dispersion coefficients, scan scales and all acceptance data so that any later reconstruction can be reproduced. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Depth-scale phantom and acceptance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：每像素深度 Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm（空氣），6.2 µm 的 δz 約占 1.8 像素。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Depth per pixel Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm in air, so the 6.2 µm δz spans about 1.8 pixels.","failure":"常見誤解：「影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「深度比例尺假體與驗收報告」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Depth-scale phantom and acceptance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-29-k1","title":"深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接","titleEn":"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff","text":"驗收必須證明深度軸可追溯：用已知厚度與群折射率的玻璃片量其在影像中的像素數，與理論光學厚度比較，確認每像素深度與線性度；用鏡面與中性濾鏡量靈敏度與衰減曲線；用散射假體確認在深度上的點擴散函數與對比。交接文件要記錄光源光譜、k 標定多項式、色散補償係數、掃描比例與所有驗收數據，讓日後任何重建都能重現。","textEn":"Acceptance must prove that the depth axis is traceable: measure the pixel count of a glass plate of known thickness and group index, compare with its theoretical optical thickness to confirm depth per pixel and linearity; measure sensitivity and the roll-off curve with a mirror and neutral-density filters; and confirm point-spread function and contrast versus depth with a scattering phantom. The handoff record stores the source spectrum, the k-calibration polynomial, dispersion coefficients, scan scales and all acceptance data so that any later reconstruction can be reproduced.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff\" is correct?","options":["影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。","提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。","驗收必須證明深度軸可追溯：用已知厚度與群折射率的玻璃片量其在影像中的像素數，與理論光學厚度比較，確認每像素深度與線性度。"],"optionsEn":["A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed.","Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution.","Acceptance must prove that the depth axis is traceable: measure the pixel count of a glass plate of known thickness and group index, compare with its theoretical optical thickness to confirm depth per pixel and linearity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"驗收必須證明深度軸可追溯：用已知厚度與群折射率的玻璃片量其在影像中的像素數，與理論光學厚度比較，確認每像素深度與線性度；用鏡面與中性濾鏡量靈敏度與衰減曲線；用散射假體確認在深度上的點擴散函數與對比。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Acceptance must prove that the depth axis is traceable: measure the pixel count of a glass plate of known thickness and group index, compare with its theoretical optical thickness to confirm depth per pixel and linearity; measure sensitivity and the roll-off curve with a mirror and neutral-density filters; and confirm point-spread function and contrast versus depth with a scattering phantom. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a425-v12-30","title":"深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「深度比例尺假體與驗收報告」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Depth-scale phantom and acceptance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：每像素深度 Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm（空氣），6.2 µm 的 δz 約占 1.8 像素。1.000 mm 熔融石英（840 nm 群折射率約 1.467）的光學厚度 1467 µm，預期 428 像素；若量到 430 像素，深度比例尺偏 0.5%，必須回頭修正 δλ 標定。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Depth per pixel Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm in air, so the 6.2 µm δz spans about 1.8 pixels. A 1.000 mm fused-silica plate (group index about 1.467 at 840 nm) has an optical thickness of 1467 µm and should occupy 428 pixels; a measured 430 pixels means a 0.5% depth-scale error and the δλ calibration must be corrected. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：執行驗收清單：玻璃片像素數與線性度（至少三個深度位置）、鏡面加 OD 2 濾鏡的靈敏度、衰減曲線與 w 值、色散補償後的點擴散函數寬度、掃描比例尺；每項附量測條件與日期，連同標定檔一起歸檔。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Run the acceptance list: glass-plate pixel count and linearity at no fewer than three depth positions, sensitivity with mirror plus OD 2 filter, roll-off curve and w, point-spread width after dispersion compensation, and scan scale; attach conditions and date to each item and archive them with the calibration files.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"每像素深度 Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm（空氣），6.2 µm 的 δz 約占 1.8 像素。1.000 mm 熔融石英（840 nm 群折射率約 1.467）的光學厚度 1467 µm，預期 428 像素；若量到 430 像素，深度比例尺偏 0.5%，必須回頭修正 δλ 標定。","textEn":"Depth per pixel Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm in air, so the 6.2 µm δz spans about 1.8 pixels. A 1.000 mm fused-silica plate (group index about 1.467 at 840 nm) has an optical thickness of 1467 µm and should occupy 428 pixels; a measured 430 pixels means a 0.5% depth-scale error and the δλ calibration must be corrected.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["每像素深度 Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm（空氣），6.2 µm 的 δz 約占 1.8 像素。","光源頻寬越寬，系統在任何深度的影像都一定越好。","增加樣品臂功率可以無限制提高靈敏度。"],"optionsEn":["Depth per pixel Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm in air, so the 6.2 µm δz spans about 1.8 pixels.","A broader source always gives a better image at every depth.","Sensitivity can be raised without limit by increasing sample-arm power."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每像素深度 Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm（空氣），6.2 µm 的 δz 約占 1.8 像素。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Depth per pixel Δz_px = z_max/(N/2) = 3514 µm/1024 ≈ 3.43 µm in air, so the 6.2 µm δz spans about 1.8 pixels. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a425-v12-31","title":"深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「深度比例尺假體與驗收報告」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Depth-scale phantom and acceptance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"執行驗收清單：玻璃片像素數與線性度（至少三個深度位置）、鏡面加 OD 2 濾鏡的靈敏度、衰減曲線與 w 值、色散補償後的點擴散函數寬度、掃描比例尺；每項附量測條件與日期，連同標定檔一起歸檔。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Run the acceptance list: glass-plate pixel count and linearity at no fewer than three depth positions, sensitivity with mirror plus OD 2 filter, roll-off curve and w, point-spread width after dispersion compensation, and scan scale; attach conditions and date to each item and archive them with the calibration files. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把空氣中的每像素深度直接套用到組織，忽略群折射率約 1.38，所有層厚都高估約 38%；若又未記錄標定檔版本，不同日期的量測無法互相比較。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Applying the air depth-per-pixel directly to tissue while ignoring its group index of about 1.38 overestimates every layer thickness by about 38%; without versioned calibration files, measurements from different dates cannot be compared.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"執行驗收清單：玻璃片像素數與線性度（至少三個深度位置）、鏡面加 OD 2 濾鏡的靈敏度、衰減曲線與 w 值、色散補償後的點擴散函數寬度、掃描比例尺；每項附量測條件與日期，連同標定檔一起歸檔。","textEn":"Run the acceptance list: glass-plate pixel count and linearity at no fewer than three depth positions, sensitivity with mirror plus OD 2 filter, roll-off curve and w, point-spread width after dispersion compensation, and scan scale; attach conditions and date to each item and archive them with the calibration files.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","執行驗收清單：玻璃片像素數與線性度（至少三個深度位置）、鏡面加 OD 2 濾鏡的靈敏度、衰減曲線與 w 值、色散補償後的點擴散函數寬度、掃描比例尺。","只要兩臂光程相等，色散就自動匹配。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Run the acceptance list: glass-plate pixel count and linearity at no fewer than three depth positions, sensitivity with mirror plus OD 2 filter, roll-off curve and w, point-spread width after dispersion compensation, and scan scale.","Equal arm path lengths automatically match dispersion."],"answer":1,"explanation":"執行驗收清單：玻璃片像素數與線性度（至少三個深度位置）、鏡面加 OD 2 濾鏡的靈敏度、衰減曲線與 w 值、色散補償後的點擴散函數寬度、掃描比例尺；每項附量測條件與日期，連同標定檔一起歸檔。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Run the acceptance list: glass-plate pixel count and linearity at no fewer than three depth positions, sensitivity with mirror plus OD 2 filter, roll-off curve and w, point-spread width after dispersion compensation, and scan scale; attach conditions and date to each item and archive them with the calibration files. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a425-v12-32","title":"深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"prerequisiteIds":["a425-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「深度比例尺假體與驗收報告」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Depth-scale phantom and acceptance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把空氣中的每像素深度直接套用到組織，忽略群折射率約 1.38，所有層厚都高估約 38%；若又未記錄標定檔版本，不同日期的量測無法互相比較。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Applying the air depth-per-pixel directly to tissue while ignoring its group index of about 1.38 overestimates every layer thickness by about 38%; without versioned calibration files, measurements from different dates cannot be compared. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接文件要記錄光源光譜、k 標定多項式、色散補償係數、掃描比例與所有驗收數據，讓日後任何重建都能重現。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff record stores the source spectrum, the k-calibration polynomial, dispersion coefficients, scan scales and all acceptance data so that any later reconstruction can be reproduced.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「影像上量到的層厚就是幾何厚度，不需折射率換算。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A layer thickness read from the image is the geometric thickness with no index conversion needed.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a425-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把空氣中的每像素深度直接套用到組織，忽略群折射率約 1.38，所有層厚都高估約 38%；若又未記錄標定檔版本，不同日期的量測無法互相比較。","textEn":"Applying the air depth-per-pixel directly to tissue while ignoring its group index of about 1.38 overestimates every layer thickness by about 38%; without versioned calibration files, measurements from different dates cannot be compared.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]},{"id":"a425-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「深度比例尺校正、假體驗證與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Depth-scale calibration, phantom validation and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","提高物鏡數值孔徑可以改善 OCT 的軸向解析度。","把空氣中的每像素深度直接套用到組織，忽略群折射率約 1.38，所有層厚都高估約 38%；若又未記錄標定檔版本，不同日期的量測無法互相比較。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Raising the objective numerical aperture improves OCT axial resolution.","Applying the air depth-per-pixel directly to tissue while ignoring its group index of about 1.38 overestimates every layer thickness by about 38%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把空氣中的每像素深度直接套用到組織，忽略群折射率約 1.38，所有層厚都高估約 38%；若又未記錄標定檔版本，不同日期的量測無法互相比較。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Applying the air depth-per-pixel directly to tissue while ignoring its group index of about 1.38 overestimates every layer thickness by about 38%; without versioned calibration files, measurements from different dates cannot be compared. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-zeiss-meditec-oct","v12o-heidelberg-spectralis","v12o-rp-photonics-oct","v12o-wiki-oct"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
